Previous, the NeXT emulator, used here as the hardware behaviour
reference and as the source of the Rev 2.5 v66 boot ROM the
testbenches execute.

  upstream:  https://svn.code.sf.net/p/previous/code/trunk
  revision:  r1850 (last change r1847, 2026-07-06)
  taken:     2026-08-31

This is a plain source export rather than a submodule.  The GitHub
mirror the submodule used to point at (probonopd/previous) stopped at
2017-12-12, which left every behaviour question being answered against
nine year old code; upstream is Subversion, which git submodules
cannot track.  The disks/ directory of blank images is not included.

The v66 ROM is byte identical to the one the mirror carried
(md5 7430f6efc82ba849d79de4f0d274793b), so the testbenches see exactly
the same machine as before.
